Aim

To develop an online bus ticket booking system for booking, cancelling, and managing bus tickets.

Algorithm
Start the program.
Register and log in to the system.
Search for buses and check seat availability.
Select seats and book tickets.
Make payment and receive booking confirmation.
Allow users to cancel tickets and post comments.
Admin manages buses, users, and reports.
Stop the program.
Result

Thus, the online bus ticket booking system was designed to manage bus details, ticket bookings, cancellations, and reports efficiently.
